  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A wire suspended vertically from one of its ends is stretched by attaching a weight of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> to the lower end. The weight stretches the wire by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>. Then the elastic energy stored in the wire is</p>\r",
